# MEENGLE - Meet Your Match

A modern, full-stack dating application built with Node.js, React-like vanilla JavaScript, WebRTC, and Socket.IO.

## 🚀 Features

### Core Functionality
- ✅ User authentication (signup, login, JWT)
- ✅ Profile creation & editing
- ✅ Match discovery with swipe interface
- ✅ Real-time messaging with Socket.IO
- ✅ Video/voice calls with WebRTC
- ✅ Photo uploads & galleries
- ✅ Moments/Stories feature
- ✅ Notifications (push & in-app)

### Advanced Features
- ✅ Payment processing (Stripe)
- ✅ Premium subscriptions
- ✅ Boost functionality
- ✅ Multi-language support (i18n)
- ✅ Analytics & heatmaps
- ✅ Offline support (Service Workers)
- ✅ A/B testing
- ✅ Fraud detection
- ✅ Rate limiting

### Tech Stack

**Backend**
- Node.js + Express
- MongoDB
- Socket.IO (WebSockets)
- JWT Authentication
- Stripe API
- SendGrid (Email)

**Frontend**
- Vanilla JavaScript (No framework)
- HTML5/CSS3
- WebRTC
- Socket.IO Client
- IndexedDB
- Service Workers

**Deployment**
- Docker & Docker Compose
- Nginx
- MongoDB Atlas
- AWS/Heroku ready

