## 🚀 Quick Start

### Development

```bash
# Clone repository
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/meengle.git
cd meengle

# Backend
cd backend
npm install
npm run dev

# Frontend (in another terminal)
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev

# Visit http://localhost:3000
```

### Production with Docker

```bash
# Build and run
docker-compose up -d

# Access
- Frontend: http://localhost
- API: http://localhost:3001
- MongoDB: localhost:27017
```

## 📚 API Documentation

### Authentication
```javascript
// Signup
POST /api/auth/signup
{ email, password, name }

// Login
POST /api/auth/login
{ email, password }

// Get profile
GET /api/auth/me
```

### Matching
```javascript
// Get potential matches
GET /api/matches/potential

// Like a user
POST /api/matches/like
{ targetUserId }

// Pass a user
POST /api/matches/pass
{ targetUserId }
```

### Messaging
```javascript
// Send message
POST /api/chat/message
{ matchId, message }

// Get conversation
GET /api/chat/:matchId

// Get all conversations
GET /api/chat/conversations
```

### Payments
```javascript
// Create payment intent
POST /api/payments/create-intent
{ amount, currency }

// Verify payment
POST /api/payments/verify
{ paymentId }
```

